This Mac (arm64 Darwin) links the macos pack locally.
Linux x86_64 ELF is built on Germany (`libssl.so.3`) and copied into gnfp-cminer-1.1.0-linux.tar.gz.
Windows PE is MinGW-w64 posix + static OpenSSL 3.0.16 (no extra DLL) and copied into gnfp-cminer-1.1.0-windows.zip.
Laptop leftover: run gnfp-cminer.exe --selftest on real Windows (wine is not on the builder).
Pack names: gnfp-cminer-1.1.0-{macos,linux,windows} on public tag v1.1.0 (no sibling tags).
https://github.com/rgsneddon/gnfp-cminer/releases/tag/v1.1.0
